olor:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Serie X &middot; Papel &middot; Benito Juárez</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"mexico-20-pesos-2003-papel\" aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 20 pesos, 2003\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-20-pesos-2003-papel.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-20-pesos-2003-papel.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 20 pesos de papel del Banco de México, serie X, anverso arriba con retrato de Benito Juárez, reverso abajo con el Hemiciclo a Juárez\" width=\"564\" height=\"572\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Ampliar</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">México</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Papel &mdash; fibras de algodón de alta seguridad</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de México (Fábrica de Billetes)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Serie / Fecha</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Serie X, México D.F., 6 de noviembre de 2003</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-116</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato grabado de Benito Juárez García; al centro, el Escudo Nacional histórico del siglo XIX.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> Monumento al Hemiciclo a Juárez, en la Alameda Central de la Ciudad de México, con la escultura de un león recostado.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Hilo de seguridad y marca de agua:</strong> banda plástica opaca vertical; rostro de Juárez visible al trasluz en la zona blanca izquierda.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> azul grisáceo y violeta tenue.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 20 PESOS, 2006, POLÍMERO ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; fon