ter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero puro &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de México (Fábrica de Billetes)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Serie / Fecha</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Serie C, México D.F., 22 de noviembre de 2006</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">120 &times; 66 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-122</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> efigie de Benito Juárez; a la izquierda, una balanza de la justicia sobre un libro que simboliza las Leyes de Reforma.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> vista panorámica de Monte Albán, Oaxaca; a la izquierda, el grabado de una joya mixteca (pectoral de oro).</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana con símbolo prehispánico:</strong> apertura transparente a la derecha con un motivo grecado y el número &ldquo;20&rdquo;.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Registro perfecto:</strong> silueta de una paloma que se alinea entre ambas caras al trasluz.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> azul y verde multicolor.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 50 PESOS, 2005 ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">50 Pesos &middot; 2005</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Serie C &middot; José María Morelos &middot; Acueducto de Morelia</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"mexico-50-pesos-2005-polimero\" aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 50 pesos\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-50-pesos-2005-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-50-pesos-2005-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 50 pesos de polímero del Banco de México, anverso arriba con retrato de José María Morelos, reverso abajo con el Acueducto de Morelia y mariposas monarca\" width=\"564\" height=\"586\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Ampliar</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero puro &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de México (Fábrica de Billetes)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Serie / Fecha</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Serie C, México D.F., 7 de septiembre de 2005</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">127 &times; 66 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-123</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato de José María Morelos y Pavón; estandarte del ejército insurgente con dos cañones cruzados y la palabra &ldquo;SUD&rdquo;.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> Acueducto de Morelia, Michoacán (siglo XVIII), con mariposas monarca (<em>Danaus plexippus</em>) en primer plano.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana transparente doble:</strong> una con contorno de mariposa, otra con el numeral &ldquo;50&rdquo; en relieve mate.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> magenta y rosa multicolor.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 100 PESOS, 2010, CONMEMORATIVO ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">100 Pesos &middot; 2010</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Conmemorativo &middot; Centenario de la Revolución Mexicana (1910&ndash;2010)</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"mexico-100-pesos-2010-polimero\" aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 100 pesos\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-100-pesos-2010-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-100-pesos-2010-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete conmemorativo de 100 pesos de polímero del Banco de México, Centenario de la Revolución, anverso arriba con locomotora de vapor y soldaderas, reverso abajo con mural de Siqueiros\" width=\"564\" height=\"553\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Ampliar</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero puro &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de México (Fábrica de Billetes)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Serie / Fecha</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Serie A, México D.F., 20 de noviembre de 2007; emitido para circular en 2010</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">134 &times; 66 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-125</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> la locomotora de vapor N.&deg; 279 de Cuautla, símbolo del transporte de tropas revolucionarias, junto a un grupo de soldaderas (Adelitas) armadas.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> fragmento del mural &ldquo;Del Porfirismo a la Revolución&rdquo; de David Alfaro Siqueiros.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana de mazorca:</strong> apertura transparente con forma de mazorca de maíz y elemento óptico reflectante.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> rojo, amarillo, ocre y verde claro multicolor.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">Todas las denominaciones de esta ficha fueron emitidas por el Banco de México, autoridad monetaria única del país; los tres billetes de polímero (20, 50 y 100 pesos) comparten el sustrato Guardian&reg; y forman parte de la familia F de billetes mexicanos, mientras que el ejemplar de 20 pesos en papel (2003) documenta el diseño inmediatamente anterior a la conversión al polímero de esa denominación.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\" style=\"position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(5,5,4,0.94); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Cerrar\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Alejar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n        <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button disabled=\"false\" aria-label=\"Acercar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\">\n        \n          <picture><source srcset=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-20-pesos-2003-papel.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-20-pesos-2003-papel.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 20 pesos, 2003, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        \n        \n          <picture><source srcset=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-20-pesos-2006-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-20-pesos-2006-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 20 pesos, 2006, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        \n        \n          <picture><source srcset=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-50-pesos-2005-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-50-pesos-2005-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 50 pesos, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        \n        \n          <picture><source srcset=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-100-pesos-2010-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"uploads/mexico-banco-de-mexico-100-pesos-2010-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 100 pesos, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        \n      </div>\n      <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
